--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Upstream Attribution & Notice
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The 3D watch body geometry in this project is derived from the official 3D CAD
drawings released by Pebble Technology Corporation in the official pebble-3d
repository:

* Upstream Repository: https://github.com/pebble/pebble-3d
* Original File: PebbleSolid-20130102.STL / PebbleSolid-20130102.STEP
* Original Copyright: (c) 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016 Pebble Technology Corporation.
  All Rights Reserved.
* Original Statement:
  "Here's the moment you've all been waiting for: the release of Pebble's
  3D drawings. We're looking forward to seeing some awesome designs on
  thingiverse! Where possible, PDF, STL, and STP files are included.
  FILES ARE FOR REFERENCE ONLY. SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE.
  All Rights Reserved. 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016 Pebble Technology Corporation."

Wall clock modifications by Jon Barlow:
- Scaled 4.314x to accommodate standard 6.0" E-Ink Pearl displays.
- Cut rectangular screen aperture matching the 600x800 active E-Ink matrix.
- Added rear drop-in pocket and retention lip for Barnes & Noble Nook Simple Touch.
- Added bottom micro-USB power cable routing channels.
- Added wall-mount keyhole slots and desktop kickstand sockets.

